rl":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T02:00:45Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T02:02:08Z","body":"#113035 did not fix this issue.\n\nAn update to a child scene file did not cause the parent scene to be reloaded. Unless the path has changed.\n\nAlthough the changed scene paths are collected in an array in the `resources_reload` signal, all scenes in the **owner** chain of the updated scene file need to be reloaded. This can be done in `EditorNode::_resources_changed()`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4009035173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017899958","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115677#issuecomment-4017899958","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115677","id":4017899958,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vfEm2","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T01:33:44Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:34:38Z","body":"To resolve this, it might be necessary to modify/reload the dependency's owner whenever it's modified. At least for **scene** files, it is necessary to notify their owners. \n\nCurrently, file owner relationships don't seem to be cached. Therefore, searching upwards for the owner is much more difficult than searching downwards for the dependency.\n\nIt may also be necessary to distinguish whether the scene is maintained by the parent scene as a PackedScene (the value of a member variable of a certain node), or whether it is instantiated as a child scene by the parent scene.\n\n```tscn\n[gd_scene format=3 uid=\"uid://dav1inpty1gvh\"]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" uid=\"uid://c0qvidn22o1d0\" path=\"res://scripts/gd/node_2d.gd\" id=\"1_6e84v\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" uid=\"uid://c1pfx1o22j38w\" path=\"res://scenes/node.tscn\" id=\"2_4dvvg\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"PackedScene\" uid=\"uid://cmxe78e5hj8ic\" path=\"res://scenes/control.tscn\" id=\"2_rnjyy\"]\n\n[node name=\"Node2D\" type=\"Node2D\" unique_id=1989618411]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_6e84v\")\nscene = ExtResource(\"2_rnjyy\")\n\n[node name=\"Node\" parent=\".\" unique_id=65981341 instance=ExtResource(\"2_4dvvg\")]\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017899958/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]